  "description": "Redis journal-log backend for OptunaSharp on NRedisStack — Redis's official .NET client. NRedisStackJournalRedisBackend persists an Optuna study's operation log to a Redis server (standalone or cluster), byte-compatible with Python Optuna and the sibling StackExchange/ServiceStack backends. NRedisStack layers the Redis Stack modules on StackExchange.Redis; a journal needs only plain GET/SET/INCR/EVAL, served via the underlying IDatabase. Part of the SciSharp STACK.",
